Pharmacy management system (Pharmer)

# Functional Requirement "App must do:"
- store all product
- buy products
- recieve products either from customer or stores
- calculate the amount of money gained by taking (price of #p, discount of store) of each product
- search in all product with options (data,amount,catogery)
- store a list of vanished products to alert
- start & end wardia
- store report for each wardia
- user can add categories for products
- Track Expiring data


# Class responsibilites

Enum categories -> Anitibiotic, cosmetics, ... (user can add new categories)
Enum Type -> tablets, capsules, sachets, vials, amp, granules, syrup, suspension.... (user can add new types)

- Product (Abstract class):
    Att:
    - name, catogory(static), types, amount(static),price(static), discount, units, expire date
    Methods:
    - Getters for each att
    - Setters for each att
    - Unitprice()


- MainWindow
    - Find
    - Buy (loop for each product end when user print 0)
    - sell (// same as buy)

- Data Structure
    Hashing and Trie



